{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id26305647"}, "name":{"label":"robert_nilsson"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-07T05:21:45-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.4"}, "id":{"label":"13823125412"}, "title":{"label":"My only weather app"}, "content":{"label":"I have been using carrot for years. It is hands down the most feature rich and effective weather app out there. It also bring snark into my life every day - a reason to smile, if only for a minute. \n\nAnd now weather channel and underground data!!!  It was the only gap as they are the most accurate in my area.\n\nNew capabilities and amazing layouts - it’s my favorite app and a model for how to keep your customers happy.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"5"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id43767002"}, "name":{"label":"Alerogls"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-06T18:54:56-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.4"}, "id":{"label":"13821711948"}, "title":{"label":"It’s a keeper"}, "content":{"label":"Wow. Even though I loved the app I wasn’t going to renew when my year was up because Weather Channel is most accurate at my location. Adding that source is a very welcome update and I have set my sub to renew! THANK YOU!\n\nNot sure when exactly it happened, but I have a weather addiction. Started my trial several hours ago and I can’t believe how great it is. I’ll be able to ditch the other three apps I was using to access different views or features. This one you can customize all on one screen exactly how you want it. Big pain point for me was how long it took to see wind details in other apps. In Carrot I was able to put it up on the view and it even shows wind and gusts for upcoming times. Final thing that sealed the deal for me is the fantastic watch complications. And for what I was paying for multiple apps I may as well pay for ultra for this one app. You guys are awesome sauce.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
