{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1519816494"}, "name":{"label":"Vhwatvwap"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-03-05T08:16:15-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.4"}, "id":{"label":"13816691930"}, "title":{"label":"Show me the world!!"}, "content":{"label":"I will not be renewing my subscription since the app does not show me the weather everywhere. If I input my location anywhere in the US it only shows me weather/rain on the MAINLAND, nothing in the oceans. If I change it to another country (not all but most) it’ll show me the rain in the oceans around the US. \n\nI dislike how this works VERY MUCH. I’d like the understand the weather and see the rain or hurricanes in the oceans that may or may not be heading for the mainland. \n\nThis also applies to hurricane season. It may show there is a hurricane in the oceans around the US but for the most part it looks like clouds. If I change my location to another county it’ll show me the rain that these hurricanes have.\n\nAnd don’t say you need to change your data source or whatever other options there are because I have tried them all. I want to see the same weather in the oceans as I would if I put my location in china.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
