{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id37234115"}, "name":{"label":"KrazyCelticKid"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-26T17:37:26-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.4"}, "id":{"label":"13793187136"}, "title":{"label":"Best Weather App By Far"}, "content":{"label":"It integrates with my Netatmo weather station to show me the EXACT temperature in my backyard. The dev is so on top of current events that I learn about notable happenings from the goofy commentary before I even get Apple News push notifications. Plus the dev is super responsive when filing bugs, the app is super customizable … it’s just the best\n\nEdit: Developer is also one of the few who put ACTUAL release notes in their updates. The effort does not go unrecognized :)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"2"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"3"}}, 
