{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id463602135"}, "name":{"label":"Weather Bender"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-19T02:16:32-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.3.3"}, "id":{"label":"13765610419"}, "title":{"label":"OG"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve been using Carrot since inception.  It’s a snarky app that always gives me a laugh and definitely the most fun weather app I’ve ever used.  It’s easy to use and you can pick which source you want your weather to come from.  I love it enough that I pay up front yearly.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1449471175"}, "name":{"label":"cobinizcool"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-02-17T06:29:01-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.3.3"}, "id":{"label":"13759172115"}, "title":{"label":"BEST APP"}, "content":{"label":"This app is SO GOOD. And I'm saying this with the free version. For the past 15 days I've had it, I've enjoyed logging in every day to hear the stupid songs, and CARROT's sarcatsic forcast jokes. I hate that everyone is complainging about it being mean or political. 1, You can turn that off. And 2, you signed up for that. The forecast is SUPER accurate and the minigames are fun. \n\nTL;DR: Some people on this app are dumb and don't know what comedy is. This app os great, no matter how much you do or don't pay. See you later meatbags", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
